&lt;p&gt;LAHORE: During the current month in Lahore, as many as 1,763 smoke-emitting vehicles were fined, while a total penalty of Rs5.5 million was imposed. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;During the same period, 739 vehicles were impounded and overloaded vehicles were offloaded in Lahore. &lt;/p&gt;

